{#
    Generic results-table cell renderer -- the fallback FormElement::getTableTemplate()
    (core/lib/FormElement.php) suggests for any field type/name/form combination with
    no more specific form_table_element_* override. Previously no file at all matched
    any of that function's suggestions, so every table cell in every webform's results
    listing (Clinics/Doctors/Operations on zpms) rendered nothing.

    $value is the raw stored field value -- always escaped here (unlike
    form_element_button.zetem's raw echo of static, yaml-authored button labels), since
    this is real, DB-stored, potentially user-entered data being displayed back.
#}
<td>{{{ $value }}}</td>
